      "term": "sem1",
      "content": "How busy are my Fridays on this plan?"
    },
    {
      "key": "m2",
      "chat": "c1",
      "role": "assistant",
      "term": "sem1",
      "content": "In semester 1 you have three Friday sessions: EEE4117F from 08:00 to 08:45, CML4607F from 12:00 to 12:45, and EEE4113F from 14:00 to 17:45. In semester 2 your Fridays are free."
    },
    {
      "key": "m3",
      "chat": "c2",
      "role": "user",
      "term": "sem1",
      "content": "What's the difference between these two plans?"
    },
    {
      "key": "m4",
      "chat": "c2",
      "role": "assistant",
      "term": "sem1",
      "open_plan": "V07",
      "content": "They differ in one elective. Power & Robotics takes EEE4118F Process Control and Instrumentation, and Imaging & Power takes HUB4049F Medical Imaging instead. Both keep EEE4117F and EEE4119F, so both meet the group 1 rule. EEE4118F meets on Tuesday and Thursday from 10:00 to 11:45 and Monday at 12:00. HUB4049F meets Monday to Wednesday at 13:00, over the lunch hour."
    }
